# Quality

Team Lead checks a point edit of a known file. Behavior and multi-file work close with `qa-engineer`, then `code-reviewer`. Do not send one-line edits to review.

QA and reviewers do not edit sources. Notes go back to the implementer. After one failed retry, leave the task open and show the defect to the user.

Do not write or run tests. Check by reading changed behavior; for UI, use the browser.

Check UI in the browser against the user scenario. If the browser did not open, say so. A secret in code or a report blocks closing.
